#### Permutation Test

For the specific data at hand, we need to shuffle the `gender` and take
the `test statistic` (difference in means) each time.


::: {#fig-permutation-test-2 .cell layout-nrow="2" layout-ncol="2"}

```{.r .cell-code  code-fold="true"}
