### All Tests Together

We can put all the test results together to get a few more insights
about the tests:


::: {#tbl-All-Tests-tt-2 .cell tbl-cap='All Tests for YRBSS Weights' tbl-subcap='["wilcox.test","Linear Model with Ranked Data"]'}

```{.r .cell-code  code-fold="true"}
wilcox.test(weight ~ gender,
  data = yrbss_select_gender,
  conf.int = TRUE,
  conf.level = 0.95
) %>%
  broom::tidy() %>%
  tt() %>%
  style_tt(i = 1, j = 5, background = "gold", color = "black")

lm(rank(weight) ~ gender,
  data = yrbss_select_gender
) %>%
  broom::tidy(
    conf.int = TRUE,
    conf.level = 0.95
  ) %>%
  tt() %>%
  style_tt(i = 1, j = 5, background = "gold", color = "black")
```

